  "description": "1.  First, determine the purchase price as a percentage of the online price.\n2. Identify which range this purchase price percentage falls into.\n3. Check Item Reviews: Look at the total number of reviews for the item.\n4. Apply Discount Based on Reviews: \n   - If the item has more than 50 reviews, use the table to determine the discount percentage based on the ratings and price percentage range.\n   - If the item has 50 or fewer reviews, directly apply the discount percentage from the \"(>2 & <=3)\" column, without considering the ratings.",
